  designNotes: 'Ditto (the user, 2026-10-17): a fresh copy of target enemy creature,
    straight from its card, appears in the slot facing it on your side; whatever
    stood there is discarded. Their best creature, now yours too, staring at itself.
    The copy is a token.'
  artDescription: A chimpanzee in a lab coat and a scientist in a lab coat facing
    each other through an empty mirror frame, each copying the other's pose exactly,
    clipboard for clipboard, down to the raised eyebrow; a banana on the scientist's
    clipboard.
  defaultTargetType: 4
